| editorial =
'''The filing'''

Two candidates filed today. One campaigns on stability. One campaigns on accountability. The voters of Noto will decide which word matters more on July 26.

The by-election is the first electoral test since the IAA became law. The coalition needs Noto to prove that accountability wins votes. The LDP needs Noto to prove that stability still sells. The result will shape the autumn budget session.

